WEBVTT

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:03.168
"Kasahari Apartments”

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:03.913
"O-Taru"

00:00:03.937 --> 00:00:05.181
"O-Taru"
WHAT?7??

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:05.364
WHAT???

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:06.906
R-Really, Cherry?!

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.943
Yes... As you can see,
there isn't a grain of rice left.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:15.414
The horror! Who knew our
financial situation was so dire?!?

00:00:15.482 --> 00:00:19.715
It's not much of a surprise.
You're working to feed four people.

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:23.586
That's right! We should all
split up and find ourselves jobs!

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:28.389
Never mind that! What're we gonna
eat for breakfast?! My breakfast™!

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:29.929
"Break-fast™

00:00:52.218 --> 00:00:55.415
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:59.020
| was born to be with you.

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:02.327
The moment I awoke...

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:06.455
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:09.933
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:10.303 --> 00:01:13.739
I was born to hold you.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.910
Lies and truths...

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:21.037
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:21.915 --> 00:01:25.783
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:27.620
...won't get to me.

00:01:28.054 --> 00:01:31.149
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:34.717
...can be ours once again!

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:39.293
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:43.165
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.570
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:51.304
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:01.254 --> 00:02:04.781
In the distant future, the interstellar
space transport, the Mesopotamia...

00:02:04.858 --> 00:02:08.294
...met disaster at the edge of the
universe, crashing on "Terra ll"...

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.058
...leaving six males
as the only survivors.

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:14.492
They manufactured general-purpose
androids, known as "marionettes”...

00:02:14.567 --> 00:02:16.501
...in the form of human females.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:18.970
In addition,
the six men raised clones...

00:02:19.038 --> 00:02:22.497
...to create their own offspring,
and founded six city-states.

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:25.545
One young man, Otaru,
living in the state of Japoness...

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:29.207
...had awakened three marionettes
containing "maiden circuits.”

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:38.650
Getting Rich Quick
Is A Sour Joy

00:02:42.762 --> 00:02:43.820
Nothing in here...

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:48.425
Nothing!

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:49.832
Nothing?

00:02:49.903 --> 00:02:51.632
Being poor sucks.

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:53.832
Shut up and help me look!

00:02:53.907 --> 00:02:55.932
But there's nothing to look FOR.

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.102
LIME!

00:02:58.178 --> 00:03:00.510
Move the dresser
for me, would you?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.048
Okay!

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:03.983
Here!

00:03:09.923 --> 00:03:13.484
All right! The gods
haven't forsaken me!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:16.188
Now I can buy rice!
Now I can eat!

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.560
Now I won't have
to get the rumbles...!

00:03:19.165 --> 00:03:21.099
Lime! Go buy it, quick!

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.302
10-4

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.459
Hold up a second!

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.596
What is it, Otaru?

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.982
Good! That's what
I like to see!

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.313
Listen, Lime! When you
go to buy the rice...

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:40.944
...I want you to smile just like
that and say, "Rice, please!"

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.080
Then, he'll probably
give you extra!

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:44.954
Okay, got it! I will!

00:03:45.124 --> 00:03:46.990
EXCELLENT! Now, go!

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:48.755
Okay! I'm going!

00:03:53.933 --> 00:03:57.927
Oh, dear... Now, Otaru, you shouldn't
go filling her head with little details.

00:03:58.004 --> 00:04:02.271
Once she concentrates on one thing,
she forgets everything else!

00:04:02.342 --> 00:04:03.969
The landlord's gonna
yell at me again.

00:04:04.944 --> 00:04:07.743
Master Otaru?
The pickles came out well today.

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:09.509
Hey!

00:04:13.486 --> 00:04:14.578
Delish!

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:16.884
Cherry, your pickles
are the best in Japoness!

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:18.446
No, the best on the planet!!

00:04:18.524 --> 00:04:20.322
Oh, please!

00:04:20.393 --> 00:04:22.828
They can't be THAT good...

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:26.456
These really ARE good.
80 good that you keep wanting more!

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:32.428
Jeez! I can't drop my
guard for a second!

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.269
Random violent acts
make me hungry.

00:04:37.510 --> 00:04:41.023
"Rice, please!", big smile!

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.640
"RICE STORE"
"Rice, please!", big smile!

00:04:43.483 --> 00:04:44.951
Whoops!

00:04:45.618 --> 00:04:47.586
| found the rice store!

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.255
Okay!

00:04:51.324 --> 00:04:53.292
Oh, if it isn't Lime!

00:04:57.463 --> 00:04:59.454
Grampa Gennai! Good morning!

00:04:59.532 --> 00:05:02.866
Good morning. You sure
are perky this morning.

00:05:03.536 --> 00:05:05.436
Oh, that reminds me, Lime!

00:05:05.505 --> 00:05:07.473
Would you like to buy one of these?

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.167
What's this piece of paper?

00:05:09.242 --> 00:05:11.438
This is called a "lottery ticket."

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:14.606
It's a magical piece of paper that
can turn you into a millionaire.

00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.847
A magical piece of paper...?!

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:30.973
"Happy Lottery--RAT #1365"

00:05:30.997 --> 00:05:32.988
"Happy Lottery--RAT #1365"
Explain this to me again.

00:05:33.066 --> 00:05:36.832
You see, Grampa Gennai said
it was a magical paper...

00:05:36.903 --> 00:05:39.463
And you bought it with
the money I just gave you?

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:43.841
Will this taste good with pickles?!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:45.378
It might!

00:05:47.914 --> 00:05:49.382
LIME

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:54.046
Now, now! Let's
leave it at that, Otaru!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:56.418
Lime is really sorry...

00:05:56.489 --> 00:05:59.390
And besides,
the money has been spent.

00:05:59.459 --> 00:06:00.324
But, still!

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:03.419
The money won't come back
no matter how mad you get at her.

00:06:06.499 --> 00:06:08.467
I'm sorry...

00:06:08.534 --> 00:06:09.831
HMPH!

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:20.938
Yikes. They say nothing is as
terrifying as a stomach spurned.

00:06:21.013 --> 00:06:22.777
He scares me!

00:06:24.117 --> 00:06:25.414
Otaru...

00:06:26.953 --> 00:06:28.921
I heard everything, Otaru.

00:06:29.455 --> 00:06:31.822
Shouldn't you be dead
or something, Hanagata?!

00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:34.826
80 she bought you a
lottery ticket instead of rice...

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:37.090
Marionettes really ARE stupid.

00:06:37.163 --> 00:06:37.959
Shut up!

00:06:38.030 --> 00:06:40.863
Now, now!
Don't take it out on me.

00:06:40.933 --> 00:06:42.867
Why, I was so concerned about you...

00:06:42.935 --> 00:06:44.903
...that I made you this!

00:06:48.174 --> 00:06:49.972
A bowl of freshly-steamed
silver-grade rice.

00:06:50.042 --> 00:06:52.340
Please, eat to your
heart's content!

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:55.504
Go ahead, Otaru...

00:06:55.581 --> 00:06:57.481
I don't want it!

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:59.609
| would be haunted with the
memory that I got it from you!

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:03.613
Hey...Otaru? What about
my act of goodwill?

00:07:04.524 --> 00:07:06.549
Hey there, Mister Hanagata...

00:07:07.059 --> 00:07:10.427
Oh, I see you're still
living the good life.

00:07:10.496 --> 00:07:12.464
Uh..er..I.

00:07:12.532 --> 00:07:15.763
We'd like to get that loan
back sometime, you know...

00:07:19.639 --> 00:07:21.038
Aw, man...

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:27.512
Nuts. Ever since they came,
I've gone from poor to super-poor.

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:30.913
| just can't support four
on what I make...

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.385
"NIPPACHI BURGER CHAIN
--NOW HIRING!"

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:35.815
Whassis?

00:07:35.888 --> 00:07:37.378
Nippachi Burger?

00:07:38.424 --> 00:07:40.893
| wonder where Master Otaru went?

00:07:42.462 --> 00:07:45.796
Who knows? Maybe the dummy is
still looking for work somewhere.

00:07:50.036 --> 00:07:52.903
| wish Otaru becomes rich.

00:07:52.972 --> 00:07:56.465
"Happy Lottery--RAT #1365"

00:07:57.343 --> 00:07:59.277
"Nippachi Burger"”

00:07:59.345 --> 00:08:02.975
Really! I should have
realized it sooner!

00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:06.944
If I work at an eating establishment,
I'll never go hungry!

00:08:07.453 --> 00:08:09.854
I've never seen a roadside
hamburger stand before...

00:08:10.523 --> 00:08:13.254
Hey, bro! Flip me a toasty one!

00:08:13.326 --> 00:08:14.589
Coming right up!

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:16.128
Just one moment...

00:08:17.163 --> 00:08:18.858
...and, it's done!

00:08:18.965 --> 00:08:21.195
Oh? It doesn't look
very smart, though.

00:08:21.267 --> 00:08:22.701
Oh, well.

00:08:22.768 --> 00:08:24.395
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:26.131
Oh, sorry about that!
I messed up the last one.

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:28.037
Hold on and I'll
make you a new one.

00:08:28.107 --> 00:08:30.303
- Make it quick, okay?
- Yessir!

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:36.938
Aw, shoot! Gross out!

00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:39.849
But...oh, well!
I'm not the one eating it!

00:08:40.353 --> 00:08:41.286
Here you go!

00:08:41.354 --> 00:08:43.789
Don't give me that...
| saw what just happened!

00:08:44.056 --> 00:08:45.387
Huh? Oh.

00:08:45.458 --> 00:08:46.857
Make me another!

00:08:46.926 --> 00:08:48.894
Coming right up! I can't
fake my way out of that one.

00:08:48.961 --> 00:08:51.259
Hey, mister! Would you
like a shake with that?

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.855
Huh? What kind you got?

00:08:52.932 --> 00:08:55.902
We have this brand-new
flavor called "pomegranate.”

00:08:56.435 --> 00:08:59.405
Pomegranate?!
What's it taste like?

00:08:59.472 --> 00:09:01.941
Beats me!
I haven't tried it yet!

00:09:02.475 --> 00:09:04.239
Hang on, I'll try it right now.

00:09:09.849 --> 00:09:11.977
I don't recommend this AT ALL...

00:09:12.518 --> 00:09:16.512
Oh, really? All right,
I'll just go with the burger.

00:09:16.589 --> 00:09:18.557
Really? Here you go then!

00:09:19.859 --> 00:09:21.384
Hey! How much do I owe you?

00:09:21.460 --> 00:09:24.088
Let's see... That was
three burgers and a shake...

00:09:24.163 --> 00:09:25.892
Stop right there!

00:09:25.965 --> 00:09:26.864
Yessir?

00:09:26.933 --> 00:09:29.459
I only asked for one burger.

00:09:29.535 --> 00:09:31.094
Yes, in the end!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.573
But I had to make two more burgers
and a pomegranate shake to do it!

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:38.909
You've got to remember
these things, mister!

00:09:38.978 --> 00:09:40.844
So! All together,
that comes to...

00:09:42.949 --> 00:09:44.348
Come again...

00:09:44.517 --> 00:09:46.815
He didn't have to hit me...

00:09:47.987 --> 00:09:48.920
Step on in!

00:09:48.988 --> 00:09:49.955
It's you.

00:09:50.022 --> 00:09:51.990
Otaru, I'll help!

00:09:52.892 --> 00:09:54.860
Forget it. You'll just get in the way.

00:09:55.294 --> 00:09:58.093
Lime's really worried about
what happened this morning.

00:09:58.164 --> 00:09:59.928
Let her make up for it!

00:09:59.999 --> 00:10:02.127
Please, Master Otaru?

00:10:02.201 --> 00:10:04.295
Please let me help, Otaru!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:06.361
But what can she do...?

00:10:06.439 --> 00:10:10.342
It's just hard to watch you
like this. Let her try, Otaru.

00:10:11.611 --> 00:10:13.238
Still...

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:15.539
Wait a sec!

00:10:20.553 --> 00:10:25.218
Damn those debt collectors...!
They didn't have to hit me so hard!

00:10:26.492 --> 00:10:31.328
But if I don't return the money quick,
the next time, they'll kill me...

00:10:31.397 --> 00:10:34.526
I have to find a way to
make some quick money...

00:10:36.969 --> 00:10:38.937
That's it! That's the ticket!

00:10:39.805 --> 00:10:42.331
Don't hate me for this, Otaru!

00:10:49.115 --> 00:10:52.141
Today, the Nippachi Burger chain
opens its advertisements...

00:10:52.218 --> 00:10:55.984
...with a bigger turnaround
of smiles than ever before!

00:10:57.189 --> 00:10:58.281
Watch the elephant!

00:10:58.357 --> 00:11:00.052
Hey, lookit that marionette...

00:11:00.126 --> 00:11:01.924
She's smiling! I don't believe it!

00:11:01.994 --> 00:11:04.258
Marionettes can't smile!

00:11:05.798 --> 00:11:08.665
Your eel teriyaki burger is ready!

00:11:09.101 --> 00:11:11.035
That's one eel-teri!

00:11:11.103 --> 00:11:12.537
May I help the next customer?

00:11:12.705 --> 00:11:14.901
They sure do smile nice, though!

00:11:14.974 --> 00:11:18.433
Yeah. Just looking at them
makes my troubles disappear...

00:11:18.778 --> 00:11:22.271
Welcome to Nippachi Burger!

00:11:24.483 --> 00:11:27.885
Hello, everyone! And,
welcome to Nippachi Burger!

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:30.888
Welcome!!!

00:11:45.037 --> 00:11:47.335
"Sold out for the day."

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.404
But how?!

00:11:55.481 --> 00:12:00.248
| can't understand it either!
But we're definitely in the red.

00:12:00.519 --> 00:12:02.783
You took their money, didn't you?

00:12:02.855 --> 00:12:05.085
Of course I did!
Don't you trust me?!

00:12:05.157 --> 00:12:07.649
Then why are we
so far in the red?

00:12:07.927 --> 00:12:09.486
What's "in the red"?

00:12:09.962 --> 00:12:13.091
It means we've lost more
money than we've made.

00:12:14.567 --> 00:12:17.730
Come on, don't any of you
know what went wrong?

00:12:18.137 --> 00:12:19.627
Think!

00:12:19.705 --> 00:12:21.469
That's easy for you to say...

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.030
Hmm, let's see...

00:12:23.109 --> 00:12:25.976
Maybe it happened when |
gave out free shakes and fries...

00:12:26.045 --> 00:12:28.013
...to all the handsome customers.

00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:32.916
Or, maybe it happened when
I threw in a free burger...

00:12:32.985 --> 00:12:34.919
...for every two ordered...

00:12:34.987 --> 00:12:36.546
That's what did it!

00:12:36.622 --> 00:12:39.057
That would definitely
put us in the red!

00:12:39.125 --> 00:12:40.593
Oh, I get it"

00:12:42.628 --> 00:12:44.460
Now what are we gonna do?!

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.056
| can't even pay the
rental on this cart now!

00:12:47.133 --> 00:12:49.830
Hey, Otaru!
The elephant is a rental, too.

00:12:54.240 --> 00:12:57.870
We're supposed to be
making money, not debts!

00:12:58.544 --> 00:13:01.514
| was a fool to expect
anything else from you.

00:13:03.949 --> 00:13:05.542
Poor Otaru.

00:13:06.252 --> 00:13:07.981
"Poor Otaru"...?

00:13:08.554 --> 00:13:10.352
You know, this was all your--

00:13:11.557 --> 00:13:13.548
All my what, Otaru?

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:14.821
Nothing.

00:13:14.894 --> 00:13:16.362
Otaru?

00:13:16.862 --> 00:13:18.330
Nothing!

00:13:24.003 --> 00:13:26.700
"Offering Box"

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:31.670
Second riches, the cash prize
of 500 ryo, goes to...

00:13:33.479 --> 00:13:35.880
...Tiger #120!

00:13:39.852 --> 00:13:41.820
So close...!

00:13:42.154 --> 00:13:43.588
What the?

00:13:43.656 --> 00:13:46.057
Something's being held
at the shrine.

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:47.923
Maybe it's more Nippachi burgers!

00:13:47.993 --> 00:13:49.392
Whatever, kid.

00:13:49.461 --> 00:13:51.327
Hey, gang!
Here, over here!

00:13:51.397 --> 00:13:53.525
Hey! Over here!

00:13:54.200 --> 00:13:55.998
Hey! It's Grampa Gennai!

00:13:56.869 --> 00:14:00.430
Hey, Gramps! What's all this about?

00:14:01.006 --> 00:14:02.098
Hum?

00:14:02.174 --> 00:14:05.166
Oh, I thought you knew about it.

00:14:05.778 --> 00:14:08.873
It's the lottery.
The day of the big draw!

00:14:08.948 --> 00:14:10.313
The lottery?

00:14:10.382 --> 00:14:11.372
"Happy Lottery--RAT #1365"

00:14:13.219 --> 00:14:15.415
Where'd you put the ticket, Lime?

00:14:15.487 --> 00:14:17.979
The ticket? Do you
mean the magical paper?

00:14:18.657 --> 00:14:21.854
Oh! I put it away in the altar!

00:14:22.261 --> 00:14:25.891
What, you're not carrying it?
Okay, go get it!

00:14:25.965 --> 00:14:27.455
Okay, got it!

00:14:27.533 --> 00:14:29.695
Oh, there's no need for that.

00:14:30.135 --> 00:14:34.003
| wrote down all the numbers of
the tickets I sold in my handbook.

00:14:34.073 --> 00:14:35.234
Way to go, Gen!

00:14:35.307 --> 00:14:37.776
Oops! They're about to
announce first prize!

00:14:44.884 --> 00:14:48.479
First riches, the cash prize
of 1,000 ryo, goes to...

00:14:50.756 --> 00:14:53.123
...Dragon #501M!

00:14:55.561 --> 00:14:58.462
Aw, no winners again...

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:01.056
But, if that was first prize...

00:15:01.133 --> 00:15:05.070
Yeesh! That means all of
the ones you sold are losers.

00:15:05.137 --> 00:15:06.434
How pathetic.

00:15:06.505 --> 00:15:09.202
Hey, didn't you become rich?

00:15:09.942 --> 00:15:11.341
Could have.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.434
C'mon, let's go!

00:15:12.511 --> 00:15:16.038
Not so fast! The "Happiness is Yours"
prize is still left.

00:15:16.115 --> 00:15:18.584
"Happiness is Yours" prize?

00:15:18.651 --> 00:15:19.914
Whassat?

00:15:19.985 --> 00:15:24.354
It's not money, but it's always
a prize that everyone can use.

00:15:24.423 --> 00:15:28.382
Last time, I believe it was
a year's supply of rice...

00:15:29.461 --> 00:15:31.054
WHAT? FOR REAL?!?

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.656
Y-You're choking me!
Leggo, you nincompoop!

00:15:33.999 --> 00:15:36.627
I need to know if it's really
a year's supply of rice!

00:15:37.002 --> 00:15:39.596
Why would I lie?!
It's the truth...!

00:15:39.672 --> 00:15:41.902
Lime! What number did you get?

00:15:42.374 --> 00:15:44.001
What number'd I get, Grampa?

00:15:46.011 --> 00:15:48.343
Hey! This is no time
to be blowing bubbles!

00:15:48.414 --> 00:15:50.348
What number'd we get?!

00:15:50.416 --> 00:15:54.819
Y..You got Rat #1365...!

00:15:55.087 --> 00:15:57.385
Rat #13657?

00:16:00.659 --> 00:16:03.219
- The official has the card!
- What?!

00:16:03.595 --> 00:16:05.893
The "Happiness is Yours"
prize goes to...

00:16:08.167 --> 00:16:10.363
Rat...

00:16:10.636 --> 00:16:13.537
. #1365M

00:16:14.473 --> 00:16:16.635
#1365..7

00:16:17.176 --> 00:16:18.439
That means...

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:20.478
...w-we won!

00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:22.036
We won!

00:16:22.548 --> 00:16:25.984
YAY! My lottery ticket won!

00:16:26.885 --> 00:16:29.877
It WAS a magical piece of paper!!

00:16:29.955 --> 00:16:31.423
Lime!!

00:16:32.024 --> 00:16:34.425
Way to go! Way to go, Lime!!

00:16:34.493 --> 00:16:37.326
| forgive you for every
single mistake you've ever made!!

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.022
You're the best! The best
marionette a guy could have!!

00:16:41.667 --> 00:16:43.135
Otaru!

00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:47.973
I love you, Otarul!!

00:16:53.479 --> 00:16:54.947
Otaru?

00:16:56.081 --> 00:16:58.049
I forgive you.

00:17:00.552 --> 00:17:02.179
WHAT???

00:17:04.923 --> 00:17:06.618
How can it be gone?!

00:17:06.692 --> 00:17:09.662
It disappeared... I put it
in here, but now it's gone!

00:17:09.728 --> 00:17:11.696
Do you think it was stolen?

00:17:13.532 --> 00:17:15.432
Hey! What're you doing
with my bike?!

00:17:15.501 --> 00:17:17.970
Don't be so stingy, old man!
I'm only borrowing it!

00:17:19.104 --> 00:17:20.572
Crap! They know!

00:17:22.508 --> 00:17:24.442
It was him.
Sic 'im, Lime!

00:17:24.510 --> 00:17:25.978
Huh? Why?

00:17:26.045 --> 00:17:27.376
He's the thief!

00:17:27.446 --> 00:17:29.380
What?! Okay, got it"

00:17:31.216 --> 00:17:32.684
I'm going too!

00:17:33.652 --> 00:17:35.120
I'm counting on you!!

00:17:36.221 --> 00:17:37.586
Move it, move it, move it!

00:17:37.756 --> 00:17:38.882
Hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:17:38.957 --> 00:17:40.925
Stop, thief!

00:17:44.329 --> 00:17:46.889
Hold it right there,
you "Happiness is Yours" thief!!!

00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:49.592
Oh, shut up and make sense
for once in your life!!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:03.004
Come back here!!

00:18:03.082 --> 00:18:04.846
Persistent little buggers!

00:18:07.986 --> 00:18:09.454
That's IT!

00:18:17.362 --> 00:18:19.922
Fly me to the opposite side,
away from them!

00:18:20.599 --> 00:18:22.067
GO, BIKE, GO"!

00:18:23.969 --> 00:18:25.437
He's nuts!

00:18:30.742 --> 00:18:32.938
Quick, Bloodberry! Throw me!

00:18:33.946 --> 00:18:35.243
Gotcha, kid.

00:18:35.314 --> 00:18:37.214
TAKE THAT"

00:18:40.919 --> 00:18:42.387
What?

00:18:45.624 --> 00:18:47.092
You're kidding"!

00:18:54.566 --> 00:18:58.230
The "Happiness is Yours" prize
is MINE!!

00:19:06.044 --> 00:19:07.068
WHAT???

00:19:07.279 --> 00:19:09.907
I'M SORRY!"!
I did it on impulse!

00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:12.917
They were too delicious...!
| couldn't help myself!!

00:19:13.051 --> 00:19:15.918
You mean, you stole...

00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:17.922
...Cherry's pickles?

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:19.253
I'm so ashamed.

00:19:19.324 --> 00:19:20.917
Then, what happened
to the lottery ticket?!

00:19:22.094 --> 00:19:22.959
Lottery ticket?

00:19:23.028 --> 00:19:25.019
"Happy Lottery
--RAT #1365"

00:19:25.564 --> 00:19:27.965
Oh? What is it doing here?

00:19:33.672 --> 00:19:36.369
Oh, brother.
Look harder next time, Lime!

00:19:37.276 --> 00:19:38.437
So-rry!

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:41.480
But it's wonderful that we
found it, isn't it, Master Otaru?

00:19:41.547 --> 00:19:43.015
Yeah...

00:19:43.081 --> 00:19:45.743
Now our food problems
will be over!

00:19:46.585 --> 00:19:47.552
Yes, sir!

00:19:47.619 --> 00:19:50.589
This is indeed the winning ticket
for the "Happiness is Yours" prize.

00:19:50.656 --> 00:19:52.055
Congratulations!

00:19:52.724 --> 00:19:56.217
Great! 80, can I get my
year's supply of rice right now?

00:19:56.728 --> 00:19:57.957
Pardon?

00:19:58.030 --> 00:20:01.466
Uh... Isn't the prize
a year's supply of rice?

00:20:04.203 --> 00:20:06.900
Oh, no! That was
last year's prize!

00:20:06.972 --> 00:20:09.907
The prize is not rice
this time, my friend!

00:20:09.975 --> 00:20:12.501
This year's
"Happiness is Yours" prize...

00:20:12.578 --> 00:20:14.046
...IS THIS!

00:20:30.562 --> 00:20:33.031
A year's supply of PICKLES!!

00:20:50.649 --> 00:20:53.949
Dear, dear... The world IS
made of money, after all...

00:20:59.992 --> 00:21:01.460
Hey, Otaru?

00:21:09.568 --> 00:21:11.536
All right!! He smiled!

00:21:12.971 --> 00:21:14.666
You guys...

00:21:14.740 --> 00:21:15.901
Let's go!

00:21:15.974 --> 00:21:17.442
Yo!

00:21:24.249 --> 00:21:29.016
Actually, you have an
important invisible something...

00:21:29.087 --> 00:21:31.954
...that money can't buy, Otaru.

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:55.240
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:21:55.447 --> 00:21:59.077
...don't go off to be alone.

00:21:59.217 --> 00:22:02.152
Just think of me...

00:22:02.220 --> 00:22:06.748
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:06.992 --> 00:22:10.758
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:10.829 --> 00:22:14.459
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:14.633 --> 00:22:18.399
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:20.268
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:20.339 --> 00:22:24.242
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:26.311 --> 00:22:28.678
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:28.747 --> 00:22:33.685
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:33.885 --> 00:22:37.549
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:37.756 --> 00:22:41.317
...one step at a time.

00:22:41.560 --> 00:22:45.258
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:49.028
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:49.201 --> 00:22:52.762
| would follow you anywhere.

00:22:53.138 --> 00:22:59.100
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:10.055 --> 00:23:12.615
What?! Someone has kidnapped Lime?!

00:23:12.691 --> 00:23:14.591
Oh, just leave her, Otaru!

00:23:14.659 --> 00:23:17.094
Are you suggesting you
actually LOVE a marionette?!

00:23:17.162 --> 00:23:20.188
I've finally come to terms
with how I really feel.

00:23:20.265 --> 00:23:23.701
There's someone out there
that's better for you!

00:23:24.035 --> 00:23:28.683
Love Prophesy Battle Royale
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:28.707 --> 00:23:33.042
Love Prophesy Battle
Royale | LOVE YOU, OTARUM
